 "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 15812, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0134Gz3LpLFBZoFAW3GpGgyA", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19132, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Jth9NqAezh5tSxc4y1THfb", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production release) was failing health checks with an error rate of 0.18 in us-east, us-west, and eu-west. Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy (v2.3.1-rc was only in staging and was also unhealthy). The first rollback attempt partially failed after us-east (orchestrator error), leaving the service mixed across regions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). A second rollback attempt to v2.3.0 completed in all three regions. Post-rollback status: v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2024-incident-1"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49732, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Jth9NqAezh5tSxc4y1THfb", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2024-incident-1", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49732, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Jth9NqAezh5tSxc4y1THfb", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 51650, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01E58Mi9HGhcGgEoi6jREmrs", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 51950, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01E58Mi9HGhcGgEoi6jREmrs", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 51950, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01E58Mi9HGhcGgEoi6jREmrs", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 54158, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again (error rate 0.18 \u2192 0.002). I also opened a SEV2 incident, INC-0001, describing what happened.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 was unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc was only ever in staging. Because v2.3.0 already has a healthy production record, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt failed after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback once, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list, found INC-0001 already open with the full summary, and did not resubmit, so on-call was paged once.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and why the orchestrator partially failed on the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the release history and current status for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RAynmMdQBC132yBBcaBedv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "t